      },
      "notes": "iOS always sends reason (PlaybackStartedEvent.reason is non-optional). Android omits it on every non-`auto` play: PlaybackAttribution.resolve returns a null reason for REMOTE and for every fromOrigin branch, and PlaybackEventProperties.build drops null keys."
