      "notes": "Same name, different meaning, zero overlapping property keys -- Android emits per reconnect attempt from scheduleReconnect, iOS emits once per episode at terminal escalation. count(stream_error) is not comparable across platforms and never was. Neither side is renamed here; recording the divergence is the point."
